{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/e048faf88b28b534531b71805de61b0e.avif?t=1770204267\" width=1233 height=279 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT IS COVENANT 21?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covenant 21 is a card game in which, through the mechanics of Black Jack, you will have to defeat the Covenant level by level. But it won't be that easy; at each level you must meet a condition to access the next one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/a828b6c4350a39286e47013e20113129.avif?t=1770204267\" width=640 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW DO I PLAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place your bet, ask for a card, stand, and beat the bank to continue progressing. Don't forget that the goal is to surpass the level, but also not to go bankrupt, so bet responsibly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't slack off!! Keep an eye on your finances, bet wisely, and stand when the risk is too high.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846840/extras/a828b6c4350a39286e47013e20113129.avif?t=1770204267\" width=640 height=115 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER-UPS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you find it complicated? Don't worry, visit the store and buy Power-Ups to help you achieve your goals.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3846840?t=1770204267","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_